  "description": "Adds Shen and reworks official champions 002-007 and 009 as Lucian, Orianna, Briar, Sivir, Kled, Xayah and Yone. Version 0.10.5 targets Teamfight Manager 2 base 0.5.1 and keeps Yone's active contract Q/W/R. Spirit Cleave now scans one current GameCtx with no process-global ledger, hits each valid enemy once inside a true 80-degree, 42000-range cone, deals 35 + 45% Attack + 6% target maximum-health physical damage, and settles exactly one shield tier for zero through five champions hit. Mod API 0.8 cannot expose W-only attack-speed scaling, so cast time and cooldown are honestly fixed at 0.5 and 8 seconds. Retired E and 0.10.4 rectangular-W native names remain no-op load compatibility only: embedded saved skill trees are not migrated, and testing the new W requires a newly created 0.10.5 save. Yone's retired body sheets are fully replaced by four identity-consistent adult-proportioned ImageGen action sheets with a narrow natural three-quarter face, visible neck and shoulders, a smaller rear-left red mask, longer legs and complete feet. Each complete action sheet is rasterized once to final native 1x hard pixels, then copied byte-for-byte into the battle atlas; high-resolution figures are no longer independently downscaled per frame and no face, arm or weapon is synthesized at pack time. The native actor rectangles, labels, timings and foot anchors remain unchanged. Legacy base-0.5.0 client/server extensions and four Ban/Pick layout overrides remain disabled by default.",
